OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians approve 3% GST as tax
OL,4,Areforms go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweeping changes to Guernsey's tax
OL,7,Fsystem have been narrowly approved by
OL,8,Fdeputies, paving the way for the
OL,9,Fintroduction of a 3% goods and services
OL,10,Ftax (GST) in 2029.
OL,12,FPoliticians voted by 22 votes for and
OL,13,F17 against to approve Policy and
OL,14,FResources' (P&R) tax package of a 15%
OL,15,Fincome tax on the first #28,000 earned,
OL,16,Fthe GST, higher social security rates,
OL,17,Fa new annual vehicle tax, higher
OL,18,Fcorporate taxes and government savings.
OL,20,FChanges to the package, which will see
OL,21,Fsmall local producers exempted from
OL,22,FGST, were also approved.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
