OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians approve 3% GST as tax
OL,4,Areforms go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FP&R said it would introduce the tax
OL,7,Fpackage in 2029, rather than 2028,
OL,8,Fafter new estimates for corporate tax
OL,9,Freceipts came in at millions of pounds
OL,10,Fmore than estimated.
